---
title: Global Tech Gauntlet
permalink: /tech-trail/
layout: false
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ meta.mainLanguage }}">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#140818" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <title>Global Tech Gauntlet</title>
    <meta property="og:title" content="Global Tech Gauntlet" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A typing-powered choose-your-own-adventure about digital citizenship, technology heroes, and the golden rules of the internet." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="/tech-trail/images/scenes/scene-gauntlet-arena.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;600;700&family=Bebas+Neue&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/write-platform.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/custom-style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="dw-body wp-theme--gauntlet tt-game-body">
    <div class="dw-shell tt-shell">
      {% if breadcrumbs and breadcrumbs.length > 0 %}
        <div class="breadcrumbs--standalone">{% include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <header class="dw-topbar tt-topbar">
        <div class="dw-topbar-brand">
          <div class="tt-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/tech-trail/images/dragons-logo.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" style="border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover;"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="dw-title">Global Tech Gauntlet</div>
            <div class="dw-subtitle">Type your path · Digital citizenship adventure</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dw-actions">
          <button id="fullscreenToggleBtn" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button" title="Toggle fullscreen">⛶ Fullscreen</button>
          <a class="dw-link" href="/tech-escape/">Tech Escape</a>
          <a class="dw-link" href="/">Back to site</a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div id="fxLayer" class="tt-fx-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div id="phrasePopLayer" class="tt-phrase-pop-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div id="toastStack" class="tt-toast-stack" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <main class="tt-main">
        <section id="titleView" class="tt-title-screen tt-view tt-view--active">
          <div class="tt-title-screen__bg"></div>
          <div class="tt-title-screen__overlay"></div>
          <div class="tt-title-screen__content">
            <div class="tt-title-logo" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/tech-trail/images/dragons-logo.png" alt="" width="96" height="96" style="border-radius:16px;object-fit:cover;box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);"></div>
            <span class="tt-location-badge">DaVinci Dragons</span>
            <h1 class="tt-title-screen__headline">Global Tech Gauntlet</h1>
            <p class="tt-title-screen__tagline">Recover the five Golden Rules by <strong>typing your path</strong>. Meet the mentors who built computing. Punch in. Think fast. Don't ship the wrong thing.</p>

            <div id="titleWelcome" class="tt-title-welcome dw-hidden">
              <p class="tt-title-welcome__badge">Step 1 · New cadet briefing</p>
              <p class="tt-title-welcome__lead">Welcome! Take a <strong>60-second keystroke test</strong> so the game sets your pace. Then your mission launches automatically.</p>
              <ol class="tt-title-welcome__steps">
                <li><span>1</span> Type the <strong>full sentence</strong> — including punctuation</li>
                <li><span>2</span> Accept your speed target</li>
                <li><span>3</span> Play your first scene</li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <div id="titleExtras" class="tt-title-extras">
            <details class="tt-tutorial tt-tutorial--compact" id="titleTutorial">
              <summary class="tt-tutorial__title">How to play ▼</summary>
              <div class="tt-tutorial__body">
                <ol class="tt-tutorial__list">
                  <li><strong>Diagnose</strong> your keystroke speed by typing one <strong>complete sentence</strong> — only correct letters count.</li>
                  <li><strong>Read</strong> each scene, then <strong>type</strong> your path — ghost text shows what to write. Branch options appear as <span class="tt-ghost-demo">Library<span class="tt-ghost-demo__slash">/</span>Tech Lab<span class="tt-ghost-demo__slash">/</span>Bridge</span>.</li>
                  <li><strong>Type the whole path</strong> shown in ghost text — every letter of the choice you pick. Then hit your speed to unlock. Fix underlined typos before you continue.</li>
                  <li><strong>Map</strong> — press <kbd>Z</kbd> (or tap 🗺️ Map) to see the campus. The glowing room is you. Gold doors are exits you can type next.</li>
                  <li><strong>Phrase check</strong> before you leave a room: type a digital citizenship sentence and a SPARK sentence. The big letter is next — press space between words.</li>
                  <li><strong>Collect</strong> trophies in your pack — tap 🎒 to inspect badges, Golden Rules, and mentor notes.</li>
                  <li><strong>Win</strong> by reaching the Final Trial and typing your Digital Citizenship Oath.</li>
                </ol>
                <p class="tt-tutorial__note">Wrong turns rewind the scene — they aren't game over. Each run scrambles side missions, but the five Golden Rules stay the main quest. Built for grades 6–8 (ITEM 2025 · 8.3.2.1).</p>
              </div>
            </details>
            <div id="typingProfileBar" class="tt-typing-profile dw-hidden">
              <span class="tt-typing-profile__stat">⌨️ Test: <strong id="profileTestWpm">—</strong> keys/min</span>
              <span class="tt-typing-profile__stat">🎯 Target: <strong id="profileTargetWpm">—</strong> keys/min</span>
              <button id="retakeDiagnosticBtn" class="tt-settings-btn tt-settings-btn--sm" type="button">Retake keystroke test</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-typo-settings">
              <span class="tt-difficulty__label">Typo forgiveness:</span>
              <input id="typoToleranceRange" type="range" min="0" max="10" value="2" class="tt-typo-range" aria-label="Typo forgiveness" />
              <span id="typoToleranceLabel" class="tt-typo-label">2 typos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-difficulty">
              <span class="tt-difficulty__label">Difficulty:</span>
              <button class="tt-difficulty__btn tt-difficulty__btn--active" type="button" data-tier="cadet">Cadet</button>
              <button class="tt-difficulty__btn" type="button" data-tier="operative">Operative</button>
              <button class="tt-difficulty__btn" type="button" data-tier="analyst">Analyst</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-golden-preview-wrap">
              <h2 class="tt-golden-preview__heading">The Five Golden Rules</h2>
              <p class="tt-golden-preview__sub">Tap a rule to preview what you will recover on your mission.</p>
              <div class="tt-golden-track tt-golden-track--title" id="titleGoldenPreview" aria-label="Golden Rules to recover"></div>
              <div id="goldenRuleDetail" class="tt-golden-rule-detail dw-hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>
            </div>

            <p id="gtgBootError" class="tt-boot-error dw-hidden" role="alert"></p>
            <div class="tt-btn-group" id="titleBtnGroup">
              <div id="titleTypingMenu" class="tt-title-typing tt-typing-panel">
                <p class="tt-title-typing__hint">Type a command below — or tap the globe</p>
                <p id="titleCommandHint" class="tt-title-command-hint">Type: <strong>ACCEPT MISSION</strong> to begin</p>
                <div id="titleGhostPrompt" class="tt-ghost-prompt"></div>
                <div class="tt-typing-meter" id="titleTypingMeter">
                  <div class="tt-typing-meter__row">
                    <span class="tt-typing-meter__label">Progress</span>
                    <span class="tt-typing-meter__value" id="titleProgressPct">0%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="tt-typing-meter__track">
                    <div class="tt-typing-meter__fill" id="titleProgressFill"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <input id="titleTypingInput" class="tt-typing-input tt-typing-input--title" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Type here…" aria-label="Title menu command" />
                <div id="titleTypedDisplay" class="tt-typed-display" aria-live="polite"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="tt-launch-actions">
                <button id="startGameBtn" class="tt-globe-btn tt-globe-btn--primary" type="button" aria-label="Start game">
                  <span class="tt-globe-btn__globe" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__sphere"></span>
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__ring tt-globe-btn__ring--1"></span>
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__ring tt-globe-btn__ring--2"></span>
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__ring tt-globe-btn__ring--3"></span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="tt-globe-btn__label" id="startGameBtnLabel">Start game</span>
                  <span class="tt-globe-btn__sublabel" id="startGameBtnHint">Keystroke test first</span>
                </button>
                <button id="continueRunBtn" class="tt-globe-btn tt-globe-btn--sm dw-hidden" type="button" aria-label="Continue saved mission">
                  <span class="tt-globe-btn__globe" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__sphere"></span>
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__ring tt-globe-btn__ring--1"></span>
                    <span class="tt-globe-btn__ring tt-globe-btn__ring--2"></span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="tt-globe-btn__label">Continue</span>
                </button>
                <button id="newRunBtn" class="tt-launch-link-btn dw-hidden" type="button">New mission</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="profileMini" class="tt-profile-mini-wrap"></div>
            <div class="tt-settings-bar" style="margin-top:14px; display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <button id="highContrastToggle" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button" title="Toggle high contrast" aria-pressed="false">🔲 High contrast</button>
              <button id="stillCameraToggle" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button" title="Keep the scene still so clicks stay easy" aria-pressed="true">📷 Still camera on</button>
              <button id="titleMuteBtn" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button" title="Toggle soundtrack">🔊 Sound on</button>
            </div>
            <p class="tt-credit">A Game by Mr. Phil</p>
            <p class="tt-music-credit">
              Soundtrack: &quot;The Complex&quot; Kevin MacLeod
              (<a href="https://incompetech.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">incompetech.com</a>).
              Licensed under
              <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div id="diagnosticOverlay" class="tt-diagnostic dw-hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="diagnosticTitle">
          <div class="tt-diagnostic__panel tt-diagnostic__panel--pop tt-typing-panel">
            <div class="tt-diagnostic__burst" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p id="diagnosticStep" class="tt-diagnostic__step">Step 1 of 2 · Type the full sentence</p>
            <h2 id="diagnosticTitle" class="tt-diagnostic__title">⌨️ Keystroke test</h2>
            <p id="diagnosticIntro" class="tt-diagnostic__intro">Type the <strong>complete sentence</strong> below — including the period at the end. Only correct keystrokes count toward your speed.</p>
            <div class="tt-diagnostic__phrase-wrap">
              <div id="diagnosticGhost" class="tt-ghost-prompt tt-ghost-prompt--diagnostic" aria-live="polite"></div>
              <p id="diagnosticPhrasePlain" class="tt-diagnostic__phrase-plain dw-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-typing-meter tt-typing-meter--diagnostic" id="diagnosticMeter">
              <div class="tt-typing-meter__row">
                <span class="tt-typing-meter__label">Sentence progress</span>
                <span class="tt-typing-meter__value" id="diagnosticProgressPct">0%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="tt-typing-meter__track">
                <div class="tt-typing-meter__fill" id="diagnosticProgressFill"></div>
                <div class="tt-typing-meter__wpm" id="diagnosticWpmFill"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="tt-typing-meter__speed-row">
                <span>Live <strong id="diagnosticLiveWpm">0</strong> keys/min</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <input id="diagnosticInput" class="tt-typing-input tt-typing-input--diagnostic" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Diagnostic typing phrase" placeholder="Start typing here…" />
            <div id="diagnosticTyped" class="tt-typed-display tt-typed-display--diagnostic" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div id="diagnosticResult" class="tt-diagnostic__result dw-hidden">
              <p class="tt-diagnostic__step">Step 2 of 2</p>
              <p class="tt-diagnostic__wpm">Your speed: <strong id="diagnosticWpm">0</strong> correct keys/min</p>
              <p class="tt-diagnostic__recommend">Recommended target: <strong id="diagnosticRecommended">0</strong> keys/min (50% of your test)</p>
              <label class="tt-diagnostic__custom-label" for="diagnosticTargetInput">Set your target (up to 150%):</label>
              <div class="tt-diagnostic__custom-row">
                <input id="diagnosticTargetInput" class="dw-input tt-diagnostic__target-input" type="number" min="40" step="1" />
                <span class="dw-muted dw-tiny">keys/min</span>
              </div>
              <button id="diagnosticAcceptBtn" class="tt-cta-btn tt-cta-btn--launch" type="button">Start mission →</button>
              <p id="diagnosticAlgoScore" class="tt-diagnostic__algo dw-muted dw-tiny dw-hidden"></p>
            </div>
            <p id="diagnosticStatus" class="tt-diagnostic__status dw-muted dw-tiny"></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section id="gameView" class="dw-hidden tt-game-layout tt-view">
          <a href="#sceneChoices" id="skipToChoices" class="tt-skip-link">Skip to choices</a>
          <div class="tt-hud">
            <div class="tt-stats-bar">
              <span class="tt-stat" title="Open trophy pack">🏅 <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statBadges">0</span> badges</span>
              <span class="tt-stat" title="Open knowledge pack">📚 <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statLessons">0</span> lessons</span>
              <span class="tt-stat">🗺️ <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statScenes">0</span> steps</span>
              <span class="tt-stat tt-stat--integrity">🛡️ <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statIntegrity">100</span> integrity</span>
              <span class="tt-stat tt-stat--reputation">⭐ <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statReputation">50</span> reputation</span>
              <span class="tt-stat tt-stat--speed">🎯 <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statTargetWpm">—</span> keys/min</span>
              <span class="tt-stat tt-stat--live-wpm dw-hidden" id="liveWpmStat">⚡ <span class="tt-stat__value" id="statLiveWpm">0</span> live keys/min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-fragment-tracker" id="fragmentTracker" title="Data fragments collected" aria-label="Data fragment tracker"></div>
            <p class="tt-you-are-here" id="youAreHere"><span id="youAreHereLabel">Briefing Room</span></p>
            <div class="tt-golden-track" id="goldenRulesTrack" aria-label="Golden Rules progress"></div>
            <button id="inventoryBtn" class="tt-pack-btn" type="button" title="Open mission pack">
              🎒 Pack <span id="packCount">0</span>
            </button>
            <div class="tt-hud-actions">
              <button id="sidebarToggleBtn" class="tt-hud-btn tt-hud-btn--sidebar" type="button" title="Mission log">📋 Log</button>
              <button id="mapToggleBtn" class="tt-map-btn" type="button" title="Campus map (Z)" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="campusMap">🗺️ Map <kbd>Z</kbd></button>
              <button id="stillCameraHudBtn" class="tt-mute-btn" type="button" title="Still camera" aria-pressed="true">📷</button>
              <button id="muteToggleBtn" class="tt-mute-btn" type="button" title="Toggle sound">🔊</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="sceneLesson" class="tt-lesson-flash dw-hidden"></div>

          <div id="inventoryOverlay" class="tt-inventory dw-hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventoryTitle" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tt-inventory__panel">
              <header class="tt-inventory__header">
                <h2 id="inventoryTitle" class="tt-inventory__title">Mission Pack</h2>
                <button id="inventoryCloseBtn" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button">Close</button>
              </header>
              <div class="tt-inventory__tabs" role="tablist">
                <button type="button" class="tt-inventory__tab tt-inventory__tab--active" data-inv-tab="trophies" role="tab">Trophies</button>
                <button type="button" class="tt-inventory__tab" data-inv-tab="rules" role="tab">Golden Rules</button>
                <button type="button" class="tt-inventory__tab" data-inv-tab="knowledge" role="tab">Knowledge</button>
              </div>
              <div class="tt-inventory__body">
                <div id="inventoryGrid" class="tt-inventory__grid"></div>
                <div id="inventoryDetail" class="tt-inventory__detail"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="sceneLoader" class="tt-scene-loader dw-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tt-scene-loader__content">
              <div class="tt-scene-loader__dots" aria-hidden="true">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="tt-scene-loader__label">Dragons Uplink</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tt-stage" id="sceneStage">
            <div class="tt-stage__viewport" id="sceneViewport">
              <div class="tt-stage__room" id="sceneRoom">
                <div class="tt-scene-bg" id="sceneBg">
                  <div class="tt-scene-bg__tint" id="sceneTint"></div>
                  <div class="tt-scene-bg__scanlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                  <div class="tt-scene-bg__depth" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tt-room-fx" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="tt-room-fx__floor"></span>
                  <span class="tt-room-fx__dust tt-room-fx__dust--1"></span>
                  <span class="tt-room-fx__dust tt-room-fx__dust--2"></span>
                  <span class="tt-room-fx__dust tt-room-fx__dust--3"></span>
                </div>
                <div id="sceneDoor" class="tt-room-door dw-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="tt-room-door__leaf tt-room-door__leaf--l"></div>
                  <div class="tt-room-door__leaf tt-room-door__leaf--r"></div>
                  <div class="tt-room-door__glow"></div>
                </div>
                <div id="sceneArrive" class="tt-arrive-sting dw-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="tt-scene-panel" id="scenePanel">
                  <div class="tt-scene-header">
                    <div class="tt-character tt-character--hero tt-character--3d" id="sceneCharacter"></div>
                    <div class="tt-scene-header__meta">
                      <span class="tt-location-badge" id="sceneLocation">—</span>
                      <span class="tt-scene-mood" id="sceneMood"></span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <p id="sceneJob" class="tt-scene-job dw-hidden"></p>
                  <p id="mentorIntro" class="tt-mentor-intro dw-hidden"></p>
                  <div class="tt-scene-split">
                    <div class="tt-scene-main">
                      <div class="tt-narrative tt-narrative--reveal" id="sceneNarrative" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
                      <button id="narrativeContinueBtn" class="tt-cta-btn tt-cta-btn--sm dw-hidden" type="button">Continue ▶</button>
                    </div>
                    <aside id="sceneHolo" class="tt-holo dw-hidden" aria-live="polite">
                      <div class="tt-holo__frame">
                        <div class="tt-holo__scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                        <div class="tt-holo__graphic" id="holoGraphic"></div>
                        <div class="tt-holo__caption">
                          <p class="tt-holo__kicker">Hologram · the situation</p>
                          <h3 id="holoTitle" class="tt-holo__title"></h3>
                          <p id="holoSituation" class="tt-holo__sit"></p>
                          <p id="holoQuestion" class="tt-holo__q"></p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </aside>
                  </div>
                  <div id="typingChallenge" class="tt-typing-challenge tt-typing-panel dw-hidden">
                    <div class="tt-typing-challenge__header">
                      <span class="tt-typing-challenge__label">⌨️ Typing challenge</span>
                      <div class="tt-typing-progress"><div class="tt-typing-progress__fill" id="typingProgressFill"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tt-typing-meter" id="challengeMeter">
                      <div class="tt-typing-meter__row">
                        <span class="tt-typing-meter__label">Unlock (speed + accuracy)</span>
                        <span class="tt-typing-meter__value" id="challengeWordPct">0%</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="tt-typing-meter__track">
                        <div class="tt-typing-meter__fill" id="challengeWordFill"></div>
                      </div>
                      <p id="challengeUnlockHint" class="tt-speed-hint dw-muted dw-tiny">Speed does most of the unlocking. Word count is a bonus, not a lock.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="oathRuleRecap" class="tt-oath-recap dw-hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
                    <div class="tt-typing-challenge__prompt" id="typingPrompt"></div>
                    <textarea id="typingInput" class="dw-textarea tt-textarea" rows="5" placeholder="Type your response here…" spellcheck="true"></textarea>
                    <div class="tt-typing-challenge__footer">
                      <span class="dw-muted" id="typingWordCount">0 words</span>
                      <button id="typingSubmitBtn" class="tt-cta-btn tt-cta-btn--sm" type="button" disabled>Submit response</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div id="typingChoices" class="tt-typing-choices tt-typing-panel dw-hidden">
                    <p class="tt-typing-choices__label">⌨️ Type your path</p>
                    <div id="choiceGhostPrompt" class="tt-ghost-prompt tt-ghost-prompt--choices" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <div class="tt-typing-meter" id="choiceTypingMeter">
                      <div class="tt-typing-meter__row">
                        <span class="tt-typing-meter__label">Path progress</span>
                        <span class="tt-typing-meter__value" id="choiceProgressPct">0%</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="tt-typing-meter__track">
                        <div class="tt-typing-meter__fill" id="choiceProgressFill"></div>
                        <div class="tt-typing-meter__wpm" id="choiceWpmFill"></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="tt-typing-meter__speed-row">
                        <span>Live <strong id="choiceLiveWpm">0</strong> keys/min</span>
                        <span>Target <strong id="choiceTargetWpm">—</strong> keys/min</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <input id="choiceTypingInput" class="tt-typing-input tt-typing-input--choices" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Type your choice" />
                    <div id="choiceTypedDisplay" class="tt-typed-display" aria-live="polite"></div>
                    <p id="choiceSpeedHint" class="tt-speed-hint dw-muted dw-tiny"></p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="tt-choices" id="sceneChoices"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="campusMap" class="tt-map dw-hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mapTitle" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tt-map__panel">
              <header class="tt-map__header">
                <div>
                  <h2 id="mapTitle" class="tt-map__title">DaVinci Dragons Campus Map</h2>
                  <p class="tt-map__sub">Red = you. Gold = a door you can type next. Teal = a room you already visited. Press <kbd>Z</kbd> to close.</p>
                </div>
                <button id="mapCloseBtn" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button">Close <kbd>Z</kbd></button>
              </header>
              <div class="tt-map__stage" id="mapStage">
                <svg class="tt-map__links" id="mapLinks" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg>
                <div class="tt-map__world" id="mapWorld"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="tt-map__legend" id="mapLegend"></p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="rhythmGate" class="tt-rhythm dw-hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="rhythmTitle" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tt-rhythm__inner">
              <p class="tt-rhythm__kicker" id="rhythmKicker">Room phrase check</p>
              <h2 id="rhythmTitle" class="tt-rhythm__title">Type this sentence</h2>
              <p class="tt-rhythm__meaning" id="rhythmMeaning"></p>
              <div class="tt-rhythm__stage" id="rhythmStage">
                <div class="tt-rhythm__lane" id="rhythmLane" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="tt-rhythm__ring" id="rhythmRing" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="tt-rhythm__count" id="rhythmCount" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="tt-rhythm__judge" id="rhythmJudge" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="tt-rhythm__phrase" id="rhythmPhrase" aria-live="polite"></p>
              <p class="tt-rhythm__hint" id="rhythmHint">Type the big letter. When it says SPACE, press the space bar.</p>
              <div class="tt-rhythm__hud">
                <span id="rhythmCombo">0 / 0</span>
                <span id="rhythmScore">100%</span>
                <span id="rhythmBpm">0 keys/min</span>
              </div>
              <div id="rhythmResult" class="tt-rhythm__result dw-hidden">
                <p id="rhythmResultText"></p>
                <div class="tt-rhythm__result-actions">
                  <button id="rhythmRetryBtn" class="tt-cta-btn tt-cta-btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button>
                  <button id="rhythmContinueBtn" class="tt-cta-btn tt-cta-btn--sm dw-hidden" type="button">Continue ▶</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="identityGate" class="tt-identity-gate dw-hidden">
            <div class="tt-identity-gate__panel tt-typing-panel">
              <h3 class="dw-h3">Mission Report</h3>
              <p class="dw-muted dw-tiny">Enter your details to submit your Digital Citizenship Oath.</p>
              <div class="tt-identity-gate__field">
                <label class="dw-label" for="identityFirstName">First name</label>
                <input id="identityFirstName" class="dw-input" type="text" maxlength="16" placeholder="Ada" />
              </div>
              <div class="tt-identity-gate__field">
                <label class="dw-label" for="identityLastInitial">Last initial</label>
                <input id="identityLastInitial" class="dw-input" type="text" maxlength="1" placeholder="L" />
              </div>
              <div class="tt-identity-gate__field">
                <label class="dw-label" for="identityClassroom">Classroom</label>
                <input id="identityClassroom" class="dw-input" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Tech: Media Arts" />
              </div>
              <div class="tt-identity-gate__field">
                <label class="dw-label" for="identityClassCode">Class passcode</label>
                <input id="identityClassCode" class="dw-input" type="password" maxlength="32" placeholder="••••" />
              </div>
              <button id="identitySubmitBtn" class="tt-cta-btn" type="button">Submit and enter</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tt-sidebar">
            <div class="tt-journal tt-journal--3d">
              <h3 class="dw-h3">Mission log</h3>
              <div id="journalEntries"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tt-journal tt-journal--3d">
              <h3 class="dw-h3">Hero notes</h3>
              <div id="researchPanel"><p class="dw-muted dw-tiny">Meet heroes during your mission to unlock notes.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="endingView" class="dw-hidden tt-view">
          <div class="tt-ending-screen">
            <div class="tt-ending-screen__bg" id="endingBg"></div>
            <div class="tt-ending-screen__overlay"></div>
            <div class="tt-ending-screen__content tt-scene tt-ending">
              <div class="tt-ending__burst" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <h2 class="tt-ending__title" id="endingTitle">Mission Complete!</h2>
              <div class="tt-narrative" id="endingNarrative"></div>
              <p class="dw-muted" id="endingLessons"></p>
              <div class="tt-badge-row" id="endingBadges"></div>
              <div class="tt-golden-track tt-golden-track--ending" id="endingGoldenTrack"></div>
              <div id="endingMosaic" class="tt-ending-mosaic dw-hidden">
                <p class="tt-ending-mosaic__label">Data Mosaic Assembled</p>
                <img src="/tech-trail/images/dragons-logo.png" alt="DaVinci Dragons emblem" width="200" height="200" class="tt-ending-mosaic__img" />
              </div>
              <p id="endingAnalystHint" class="tt-ending__analyst dw-hidden">
                Ready for a harder typing gauntlet?
                <button id="tryAnalystBtn" class="tt-settings-btn" type="button">Try Analyst next run</button>
              </p>
              <button id="playAgainBtn" class="tt-cta-btn" type="button">Play again</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script src="/scripts/write-test-core.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/diagnostic-writing-calibration.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/write-analysis-engine.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-typing-engine.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-visuals.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-story.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-state.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-audio.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-rhythm.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/tech-trail-app.js" defer></script>
    <script>if('serviceWorker' in navigator)navigator.serviceWorker.register('/tech-trail/sw.js');</script>
  </body>
</html>
